        "func": "let id_c = msg.payload;\nlet time = new Date();\n\n// Format the date as DD-MM-YYYY\nlet date = time.toISOString().split('T')[0];\nlet dateFormat = date.split('-').reverse().join('-');\n\nlet electrode_id_c = \"CE \" + dateFormat + \" \" + id_c;\n\nflow.set(\"ID_c\", electrode_id_c);\n\nmsg.payload = electrode_id_c;\n  \nreturn msg;\n",
